    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>subclass of :class:`~HTTPClientError`

This indicates that the origin server requires the request to be
conditional.  From RFC 6585, &quot;Additional HTTP Status Codes&quot;.

code: 428, title: Precondition Required
</verbatim> </para>
